WEBVTT

00:00:04.740 --> 00:00:07.880
I guess even a place like this has a bath.

00:00:14.930 --> 00:00:16.540
Feels great.

00:00:39.370 --> 00:00:41.040
Sorry!{Karura IS BACK!!!!}

00:00:41.040 --> 00:00:42.840
I didn't think anyone else was here.

00:00:46.250 --> 00:00:47.990
Don't be in such a rush.

00:00:52.390 --> 00:00:53.880
How about a drink?

00:01:10.260 --> 00:01:11.400
This is good!

00:01:11.800 --> 00:01:14.640
This all seems familiar somehow...

00:01:15.740 --> 00:01:16.790
What is this sake?

00:01:18.020 --> 00:01:19.780
Did you enjoy it?

00:01:22.970 --> 00:01:24.790
May I have {another}more?{Period: "more" ?}

00:01:27.560 --> 00:01:28.650
By the way...

00:01:28.650 --> 00:01:29.660
Yes?

00:01:34.210 --> 00:01:36.050
{What's that chain on your neck?}What's with the chain around your neck?

00:01:39.480 --> 00:01:41.760
These are quite popular nowadays.{Period: i bet}

00:01:49.510 --> 00:01:51.190
My name's Haku.

00:01:51.190 --> 00:01:54.440
I've been staying at this inn for a while.

00:01:55.180 --> 00:01:56.190
Haku?

00:02:02.460 --> 00:02:04.650
That's quite an unusual name.

00:02:05.610 --> 00:02:06.950
Is it?

00:02:17.210 --> 00:02:18.720
We'll meet again...

00:02:22.650 --> 00:02:24.600
{and }soon.

00:02:31.940 --> 00:02:33.020
This {really is}is really good.

00:04:24.380 --> 00:04:33.790
"I have acquired rare sake and delicacies from a foreign land,

00:04:33.790 --> 00:04:37.020
{and I would like your attendance..."}{SIII: }and I would like you to attend..."

00:04:37.480 --> 00:04:41.580
"And if you wish to bring friends,
they are more than welcome.

00:04:41.580 --> 00:04:44.650
From Keihaku, the master of Hakuroukaku."

00:04:45.340 --> 00:04:50.930
It's an invitation to a banquet, 
and you're welcome to bring guests.

00:04:50.930 --> 00:04:52.120
I see.

00:04:53.100 --> 00:04:55.000
Wait, when did you get here!?

00:04:55.950 --> 00:04:57.160
What about you?

00:04:57.160 --> 00:05:00.270
Since when did <i>you</i> know the owner of the inn?

00:05:00.850 --> 00:05:01.550
Owner?

00:05:06.420 --> 00:05:07.870
She's the owner?

00:05:07.870 --> 00:05:08.680
I see...

00:05:09.920 --> 00:05:12.790
But how would you...

00:05:12.790 --> 00:05:16.430
Don't tell me you caused 
some kind of trouble again.

00:05:16.430 --> 00:05:18.620
What do you mean, "again"?

00:05:18.620 --> 00:05:22.680
We happened to be in{SIII: at} the same place earlier, 
and she gave me some sake.

00:05:22.680 --> 00:05:24.240
Is that really true?

00:05:24.240 --> 00:05:25.920
Of course!

00:05:27.500 --> 00:05:28.200
I know!

00:05:28.200 --> 00:05:29.700
Want to come along?

00:05:29.700 --> 00:05:32.990
It does say I can bring others.

00:05:34.510 --> 00:05:35.200
Sure.

00:05:35.200 --> 00:05:39.240
If there's good food and sake,
it'd be unfair to let you have it all to yourself.

00:05:45.440 --> 00:05:50.340
The letter said she'd be waiting on the top floor...

00:05:51.520 --> 00:05:55.350
I've never been up this way.

00:05:58.780 --> 00:06:00.870
Looks like it goes up further.

00:06:00.870 --> 00:06:03.610
Does she like high places?

00:06:12.900 --> 00:06:14.920
So this is the top floor?

00:06:22.030 --> 00:06:23.900
What a spectacular view!

00:06:31.160 --> 00:06:34.090
But it doesn't look like anyone's here.

00:06:34.090 --> 00:06:35.330
Yeah.

00:06:40.530 --> 00:06:41.270
What is it?

00:06:54.030 --> 00:06:55.560
It moves?

00:06:55.560 --> 00:06:57.790
Yup! It's a type of puzzle!

00:06:58.180 --> 00:07:01.790
It's very similar to the ones my mother liked.

00:07:05.340 --> 00:07:06.040
Look!

00:07:09.850 --> 00:07:10.880
What going on?

00:07:25.690 --> 00:07:27.930
I had no idea that would happen.

00:07:27.930 --> 00:07:31.070
I guess that means there's still more to go.

00:07:31.070 --> 00:07:32.570
W-Wait!

00:07:32.570 --> 00:07:33.670
What's wrong?

00:07:35.420 --> 00:07:36.930
I don't know.

00:07:36.930 --> 00:07:39.580
But, well... I just sort of...

00:07:42.110 --> 00:07:44.150
Come on, let's go.

00:07:44.960 --> 00:07:46.030
Haku!

00:07:46.030 --> 00:07:47.960
W-Wait a second...

00:07:55.140 --> 00:07:58.350
I've got a bad feeling about this.

00:08:06.670 --> 00:08:07.610
What the heck...

00:08:08.020 --> 00:08:09.610
There's nobody here either?

00:08:14.610 --> 00:08:15.610
Haku!

00:08:16.130 --> 00:08:18.000
Hey, Haku, come on!

00:08:42.190 --> 00:08:43.400
Haku!

00:08:43.400 --> 00:08:44.510
Where are you?

00:08:44.510 --> 00:08:46.140
Oh, welcome!

00:08:49.900 --> 00:08:51.270
Kuon!

00:08:51.270 --> 00:08:52.220
I can't move!

00:08:53.150 --> 00:08:56.380
S-Sorry for interrupting...

00:08:56.380 --> 00:08:57.160
Kuon!

00:08:57.160 --> 00:08:58.530
Y-Yes?

00:08:58.530 --> 00:09:00.740
What are you doing?

00:09:00.740 --> 00:09:02.550
Th-That's...

00:09:03.430 --> 00:09:05.300
what I should be asking.

00:09:06.280 --> 00:09:07.540
Fair enough.

00:09:07.540 --> 00:09:10.290
He reminds me of him, somehow...

00:09:13.860 --> 00:09:15.050
Must be my imagination.

00:09:19.470 --> 00:09:21.810
<i>What the heck's going on?</i>

00:09:23.630 --> 00:09:25.310
I'm glad you're doing well,

00:09:26.560 --> 00:09:27.890
Mothe—

00:09:33.440 --> 00:09:34.730
Did you say something?

00:09:34.730 --> 00:09:36.430
N-No...

00:09:36.430 --> 00:09:39.450
<i>Big Sister</i> Karura.

00:09:39.450 --> 00:09:42.210
So you <i>do</i> know her, Kuon?

00:09:42.210 --> 00:09:45.660
Sh-She was one of the people who 
raised me, so she's like a moth—

00:09:45.660 --> 00:09:47.780
I-I mean, a big sister to me.

00:09:48.480 --> 00:09:52.490
She left the country a long time ago,
so I hadn't heard from her in a while.

00:09:52.490 --> 00:09:55.460
I had no idea she was here.

00:09:56.700 --> 00:09:58.900
Fate is the strangest thing.

00:09:58.900 --> 00:10:00.140
Is it not?

00:10:02.440 --> 00:10:03.900
Hey, Kuon.

00:10:03.900 --> 00:10:05.970
Wh-What is it?

00:10:05.970 --> 00:10:07.880
Why are you all stiff?

00:10:07.880 --> 00:10:09.510
Huh? Um...

00:10:09.510 --> 00:10:11.980
{That's not true at all...}What are you talking about?

00:10:11.980 --> 00:10:14.880
I'm the same as always...

00:10:14.880 --> 00:10:17.740
No you're not.{Not even close.} You're talking all weird.

00:10:17.740 --> 00:10:19.920
R-Really now?

00:10:19.920 --> 00:10:20.970
Excuse me.

00:10:22.140 --> 00:10:24.310
Our guests are waiting.

00:10:24.310 --> 00:10:27.500
I apologize for being la—

00:10:27.500 --> 00:10:28.710
Kuon!

00:10:28.710 --> 00:10:30.740
Wait, then our guest is...

00:10:30.740 --> 00:10:32.500
Huh? That voice...

00:10:32.500 --> 00:10:34.780
I-It's your imagination!

00:10:35.630 --> 00:10:36.980
Watch out!

00:10:38.000 --> 00:10:39.570
Th-Thank you.

00:10:39.570 --> 00:10:42.360
Honestly, you're as clumsy as ever.

00:10:42.360 --> 00:10:43.820
Don't say that...

00:10:46.640 --> 00:10:48.390
It really <i>is</i> you, Mother Touka!

00:10:48.390 --> 00:10:52.020
No, no, no. I'm just a servant, see...

00:10:52.020 --> 00:10:54.210
Mother Touka?

00:10:55.350 --> 00:10:57.000
Karura!

00:10:58.920 --> 00:11:01.780
I had no idea you two were so close, though!

00:11:01.780 --> 00:11:04.160
You could've told me sooner!

00:11:04.160 --> 00:11:06.580
Oh, well...

00:11:07.180 --> 00:11:08.370
That's because...

00:11:08.370 --> 00:11:11.920
Well, I have no idea what's going on, but...

00:11:13.810 --> 00:11:15.540
Can we start drinking now?

00:11:22.680 --> 00:11:23.690
Shush!

00:11:23.690 --> 00:11:24.800
What?

00:11:25.130 --> 00:11:26.890
We were invited here for a banquet!

00:11:26.890 --> 00:11:28.430
You're being rude.

00:11:31.440 --> 00:11:35.430
Come to think of it, what was your name?

00:11:36.020 --> 00:11:37.890
My name is Haku.

00:11:37.890 --> 00:11:39.200
I said that before, but...

00:11:40.730 --> 00:11:42.780
Ah yes, Haku. That's right.

00:11:44.460 --> 00:11:46.270
What does it mean?{omg her face. that's amazing}

00:11:46.270 --> 00:11:49.300
Kuon came up with it, so I don't really know.{LOL}

00:11:50.040 --> 00:11:55.260
It, uh... It doesn't really mean anything...

00:11:56.040 --> 00:11:59.120
I'll call you Haku-sama, then.

00:11:59.120 --> 00:12:01.990
No, just Haku is fine.

00:12:01.990 --> 00:12:04.400
That formal stuff feels weird to me.

00:12:05.550 --> 00:12:08.140
You heard him, Touka.

00:12:09.560 --> 00:12:12.170
Try saying his name.

00:12:15.160 --> 00:12:18.310
M-Master Haku...{IM FANGIRLING SO HARD}

00:12:18.810 --> 00:12:20.740
Why are you guys all so formal?

00:12:20.740 --> 00:12:21.570
Just call me Haku.

00:12:21.570 --> 00:12:24.490
W-With no title or anything?

00:12:24.490 --> 00:12:26.100
H... Ha...

00:12:26.100 --> 00:12:28.570
Ha... ku...

00:12:28.570 --> 00:12:30.330
Yep. Haku.

00:12:30.330 --> 00:12:31.600
Nice to meet you.

00:12:31.600 --> 00:12:33.120
Y-Yeah.

00:12:34.280 --> 00:12:36.280
Well, that's fine.

00:12:36.280 --> 00:12:37.830
More importantly, Kuon...

00:12:38.580 --> 00:12:40.720
Have you been well{, Kuon}?

00:12:40.720 --> 00:12:41.800
Yes!

00:12:41.800 --> 00:12:44.590
U-Um, well...

00:12:44.990 --> 00:12:47.490
H-How wonderful it is to see you again.

00:12:47.490 --> 00:12:51.600
Have you been well, Mother Touka?

00:12:51.600 --> 00:12:53.040
Y-Yeah...

00:12:58.210 --> 00:12:59.110
Hey, Kuon.

00:12:59.110 --> 00:13:01.060
Wh-What is it?

00:13:01.060 --> 00:13:03.450
You haven't seen your family 
in a long time, right?

00:13:03.450 --> 00:13:05.110
Y-Yeah.

00:13:06.550 --> 00:13:10.500
I was raised by many different mothers.

00:13:12.150 --> 00:13:15.880
There was Mother Touka, and Mo—

00:13:15.880 --> 00:13:17.110
Big Sister Karura.

00:13:17.750 --> 00:13:19.170
Really?

00:13:19.170 --> 00:13:21.280
I don't quite get it, though.

00:13:21.940 --> 00:13:27.510
In your country, do you get nervous 
when you meet your family?

00:13:27.510 --> 00:13:29.580
O-Of course not!

00:13:29.580 --> 00:13:32.070
That's right! Of course not!

00:13:32.070 --> 00:13:35.270
That's the one thing you can 
get on the same page about?

00:13:36.730 --> 00:13:38.580
She's just an awkward girl.

00:13:40.320 --> 00:13:41.650
You're one to talk.

00:13:44.970 --> 00:13:48.650
How about a little game, then?

00:13:49.970 --> 00:13:50.660
A game?

00:13:51.710 --> 00:13:53.790
Oh, now that's a great idea.

00:13:53.790 --> 00:13:55.160
Haku, wait!

00:13:55.160 --> 00:13:59.420
Let's have some sake and get this party started!

00:13:59.420 --> 00:14:01.420
I have no intention of losing.

00:14:02.780 --> 00:14:03.420
All right.

00:14:04.620 --> 00:14:05.550
Let us begin.

00:14:12.050 --> 00:14:13.050
That's enough.

00:14:14.790 --> 00:14:15.930
One more cup...

00:14:17.880 --> 00:14:20.220
You can certainly hold your liquor.

00:14:20.920 --> 00:14:23.060
He never even stood a chance.

00:14:28.820 --> 00:14:31.050
I can keep going!

00:14:31.050 --> 00:14:33.420
No. No more.

00:14:33.420 --> 00:14:34.900
Here, have some water.

00:14:35.580 --> 00:14:38.580
Jeez, look at how much you spilled.

00:14:38.580 --> 00:14:41.000
You can be such a handful.

00:14:41.000 --> 00:14:42.830
That's right.

00:14:42.830 --> 00:14:45.410
That's my Kuon.

00:14:45.410 --> 00:14:47.150
That's why I...

00:14:48.590 --> 00:14:51.180
Don't blame it on me!

00:14:51.180 --> 00:14:53.070
You just wanted to drink.

00:14:53.070 --> 00:14:54.600
No, it's true!

00:14:56.360 --> 00:14:58.170
The sake was great!

00:15:04.280 --> 00:15:06.440
He's quite the free spirit.

00:15:06.440 --> 00:15:08.870
"Troublemaker" is the word you're looking for.

00:15:15.640 --> 00:15:17.860
Just like your childhood self.

00:15:18.570 --> 00:15:20.200
Come to think of it...

00:15:20.200 --> 00:15:21.870
Where did you get it from, I wonder?{.}

00:15:21.870 --> 00:15:24.660
You were quite the free spirit yourself.

00:15:24.660 --> 00:15:28.980
Th-That's not true. Definitely not.

00:15:28.980 --> 00:15:33.260
You were a walking ball of curiosity back then.

00:15:34.360 --> 00:15:37.760
The only time you were quiet 
was when you were asleep.

00:15:37.760 --> 00:15:40.770
If we tried to make you study, you'd run away.

00:15:40.770 --> 00:15:44.600
And then one day you found the sake 
we'd hidden in the storehouse...

00:15:45.640 --> 00:15:47.160
I can't hear you!

00:15:47.160 --> 00:15:50.780
{Adults are supposed to let 
children's bygones be bygones!}{sorry qqwerty but im not keeping that}Adults are supposed to let that stuff go!

00:15:54.510 --> 00:15:56.640
This is <i>exactly</i> why I didn't want this...

00:15:57.510 --> 00:16:01.540
But it ended up just like he said, didn't it?

00:16:02.820 --> 00:16:04.100
Indeed.

00:16:04.100 --> 00:16:07.290
I feel like I've finally seen the Kuon of old.

00:16:13.910 --> 00:16:16.250
You're all so mean...

00:16:18.530 --> 00:16:22.380
I was happy to see you both, too.

00:16:22.380 --> 00:16:25.770
But I just thought maybe 
it wasn't time for that yet.

00:16:26.310 --> 00:16:27.210
Why?

00:16:29.220 --> 00:16:32.110
It's been a long time since I left home,

00:16:32.110 --> 00:16:37.400
but I don't feel like I'm quite as 
{adult}mature as the two of you are yet.

00:16:37.400 --> 00:16:42.040
So I didn't know how to face you.

00:16:45.050 --> 00:16:47.040
I can't blame you for laughing at me.

00:16:47.040 --> 00:16:49.820
I'm still a kid.

00:16:49.820 --> 00:16:51.050
You heard her.

00:16:53.790 --> 00:16:57.050
Somebody else was saying the exact same thing.

00:16:58.300 --> 00:17:00.120
Th-That's right.

00:17:00.120 --> 00:17:03.680
I felt embarrassed too, actually.

00:17:03.680 --> 00:17:04.910
Why?

00:17:04.910 --> 00:17:07.260
B-Because...

00:17:07.260 --> 00:17:10.300
I left the country saying I'd be back soon,

00:17:10.300 --> 00:17:13.190
but I was just killing time in a place like this.

00:17:13.190 --> 00:17:17.070
I felt ashamed to face you and everyone else...

00:17:17.710 --> 00:17:20.200
You don't need to worry about that.

00:17:20.200 --> 00:17:21.990
That's right.

00:17:21.990 --> 00:17:24.230
You just aren't worried enough.

00:17:25.770 --> 00:17:30.640
But then, why did you call 
Haku to meet with me?

00:17:31.420 --> 00:17:33.090
That's because...

00:17:33.090 --> 00:17:35.050
Hold it right there! Don't say any more!

00:17:35.050 --> 00:17:37.660
"What's the relationship between those two?"

00:17:37.660 --> 00:17:39.750
"Who is that man?"

00:17:39.750 --> 00:17:41.100
It was all she'd talk about.

00:17:41.100 --> 00:17:47.660
W-Well, as Kuon's mother, I just wanted 
to know if he was worthy of her.

00:17:48.880 --> 00:17:53.350
B-But it looks like you've found 
yourself a good man. That's great.

00:17:53.350 --> 00:17:56.610
Kuon, I hope you two live long, happy lives together.

00:17:56.980 --> 00:17:58.380
What are you talking about?

00:17:59.750 --> 00:18:03.330
Haku and I are just traveling together.

00:18:03.330 --> 00:18:05.660
If anything, I'm like his guardian.

00:18:05.660 --> 00:18:07.120
Something like that?

00:18:08.340 --> 00:18:11.020
You haven't sworn the vows 
between husband and wife?

00:18:11.020 --> 00:18:12.220
Why would we?

00:18:14.880 --> 00:18:18.300
K-Karura, you knew!

00:18:18.920 --> 00:18:20.750
Karura!

00:18:20.750 --> 00:18:23.150
Mother Touka, please calm down!

00:18:24.640 --> 00:18:28.640
Now then, let's have that banquet.

00:18:29.000 --> 00:18:31.310
Touka, the food, if you wouldn't mind.

00:18:32.230 --> 00:18:33.900
I'll get you for this.

00:18:40.110 --> 00:18:41.910
You haven't had any of this in ages, huh?

00:18:41.910 --> 00:18:44.170
Eat to your heart's content.

00:18:44.170 --> 00:18:45.910
Wow! Mororo!

00:18:53.000 --> 00:18:56.420
You're able to understand the value 
of these things now, aren't you?

00:18:59.450 --> 00:19:01.160
Thanks!

00:19:07.220 --> 00:19:09.540
It's so good!

00:19:10.400 --> 00:19:12.390
There's plenty more.

00:19:12.390 --> 00:19:14.790
Children should eat their fill.

00:19:14.790 --> 00:19:16.980
Yeah! Today I'm a child!

00:19:16.980 --> 00:19:19.420
Come on! Join me, you two!

00:19:19.420 --> 00:19:21.050
Open wide!

00:19:26.440 --> 00:19:28.740
I think {I'm done here...}I've had enough...

00:19:29.150 --> 00:19:32.250
Really? You don't eat as much as you used to.

00:19:33.930 --> 00:19:38.940
Just seeing you two again filled me right up.

00:19:38.940 --> 00:19:41.670
You've certainly brushed up on your wit, I see.

00:19:43.390 --> 00:19:45.760
Can I ask something?

00:19:45.760 --> 00:19:46.950
What is it?

00:19:47.360 --> 00:19:51.520
Is it a coincidence that you two are here?

00:19:53.100 --> 00:19:58.390
We were surprised when we saw you here, too.

00:19:59.470 --> 00:20:02.490
{What did you feel as you
looked at this nation, Yamato?}When you stepped into Yamato, what did you think?

00:20:05.430 --> 00:20:11.700
I hate to say it, but everything's bigger than in our country.

00:20:12.070 --> 00:20:13.100
Indeed.

00:20:13.100 --> 00:20:15.750
Yamato's developing at an astonishing rate.

00:20:16.780 --> 00:20:22.260
{But whether that will be to Tusukuru's 
advantage in the future, or...}But whether it will be an advantage 
to the nation of Tusukuru in the future, or not...

00:20:22.260 --> 00:20:26.680
So we decided to stay here 
for a while and investigate.

00:20:26.680 --> 00:20:28.090
I see.

00:20:29.240 --> 00:20:32.270
The people, the culture, the economy...

00:20:32.270 --> 00:20:33.370
All those things.

00:20:36.630 --> 00:20:41.530
But there's one major thing that Yamato lacks.

00:20:43.290 --> 00:20:44.390
Don't {you }know?

00:20:45.710 --> 00:20:46.800
It's...

00:20:51.310 --> 00:20:55.660
Yes, Yamato{ didn't have} doesn't have any big baths.

00:20:58.120 --> 00:21:01.170
It had some, but they were all steam baths.

00:21:01.170 --> 00:21:02.750
I see.

00:21:03.720 --> 00:21:06.500
So we decided to build our own.

00:21:06.500 --> 00:21:08.240
It was quite difficult.

00:21:08.240 --> 00:21:09.940
Difficult for whom?

00:21:09.940 --> 00:21:12.910
I'm the one who had to arrange everything.

00:21:12.910 --> 00:21:16.030
You even brought Master Urutorii out here to create a water vein...

00:21:16.030 --> 00:21:17.690
What were you thinking?

00:21:19.190 --> 00:21:23.060
Y-You brought Mother Uru out here just for that?

00:21:23.060 --> 00:21:24.990
Amazing, Mo—

00:21:25.570 --> 00:21:27.200
{I mean, Sister Karura}S-Sister Karura!

00:21:28.350 --> 00:21:32.970
I guess I'm just not at my moms' level yet.

00:21:33.630 --> 00:21:35.070
Touka, go get it.

00:21:49.210 --> 00:21:50.080
Kuon.

00:21:55.770 --> 00:21:56.730
Is this really okay?

00:21:58.480 --> 00:22:01.980
You seemed worried about whether 
you're truly an adult or not.

00:22:01.980 --> 00:22:04.490
But there was never any need to be.

00:22:06.180 --> 00:22:08.490
We decided that you became 
one a long time ago.

00:22:08.490 --> 00:22:12.510
You've left us and set out by yourself,

00:22:12.510 --> 00:22:15.260
so you're an adult now, too.

00:22:15.260 --> 00:22:19.140
That said, a certain <i>someone</i> was extremely worried about you.

00:22:19.140 --> 00:22:20.090
Shut up!

00:22:20.090 --> 00:22:22.460
I couldn't help it! That's just who I am!

00:22:23.360 --> 00:22:26.010
Thank you, Mother!

00:22:27.800 --> 00:22:28.510
Now...

00:22:29.390 --> 00:22:33.010
To the eternal prosperity of Tusukuru!{To an eternal Tusukuru!}

00:22:38.880 --> 00:22:40.090
I'm so happy!

00:22:40.750 --> 00:22:42.540
I never imagined this day would come!

00:22:43.400 --> 00:22:45.740
I should be the one saying that.

00:22:46.940 --> 00:22:48.650
Here, have another.

00:22:52.810 --> 00:22:55.230
Is this...

00:22:55.230 --> 00:22:56.410
So you did notice.

00:22:56.940 --> 00:22:59.160
That's right, she made this.

00:23:01.710 --> 00:23:05.500
She wanted us to save it for a day like this.{Eruruu?}

00:23:14.460 --> 00:23:15.130
Yeah.

00:23:28.540 --> 00:23:29.710
It's delicious.
